tasks.description:
handleToday(chatId, ownerChatId): owner-only gate. (1) Reads workspace/scs001/manual-posts.jsonl for recordedCount + timestamps. (2) Computes: postsNeeded=30-recordedCount, daysLeft=max(1,ceil((Apr7-now)/86400000)), todayTarget=ceil(postsNeeded/daysLeft), rateNeeded=postsNeeded/daysLeft. (3) Reads workspace/scs001/publish-ledger.jsonl — finds first unposted entry (not in manual-posts IDs), sorted by published_at desc. (4) Reads workspace/scs001/viral-topics.json — takes first 3 items from topics[]. (5) Message format: '🌅 *Good morning* — Today's mission

🎯 Post *{todayTarget}* video(s) today ({rateNeeded.toFixed(1)}/day to hit gate)
📅 {daysLeft} days left | {recordedCount}/30 posted

📹 *Next video to post:*
`{video_id}` → /caption {video_id}
(or /post-now for full checklist)

🔥 *Trending topics:*
• {topic1}
• {topic2}
• {topic3}

→ /queue for full list | /pace for pace math'. If no unposted video: show '✅ Queue empty — run pipeline or check /queue'. If recordedCount >= 30: show gate-met message. Also add '/today — Morning cockpit: target + next video + trending topics (owner)' to handleHelp.
